{
    "name": "dsl-project",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "description": "SPC-CML — Compilador Semantico de Prompts: DSL clinica, Grafo de Conhecimento e decodificacao restrita por gramatica",
    "main": "index.js",
    "type": "module",
    "scripts": {
        "langium:generate": "langium generate",
        "build": "npm run langium:generate && tsc",
        "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
        "validate": "tsx src/cli/validate.ts",
        "bnf:export": "tsx src/cli/export-bnf.ts",
        "graph:sync": "tsx src/database/neo4j.ts",
        "pipeline": "tsx src/cli/pipeline.ts",
        "infer": "tsx src/inference/llm-client.ts",
        "batch": "tsx src/inference/batch-client.ts",
        "bnf:export:agro": "tsx src/cli/export-bnf-agro.ts",
        "graph:sync:agro": "tsx src/database/neo4j-agro.ts",
        "batch:agro": "tsx src/inference/agro-client.ts",
        "bnf:export:fut": "tsx src/cli/export-bnf-fut.ts",
        "graph:sync:fut": "tsx src/database/neo4j-fut.ts",
        "foco:inspecionar": "tsx src/cli/inspecionar-foco.ts",
        "batch:fut": "tsx src/inference/fut-client.ts",
        "ground-truth:fut": "tsx src/scripts/gerar-ground-truth-fut.ts",
        "start": "tsx src/inference/cli.ts",
        "web:api": "tsx src/web/server.ts",
        "deploy:med": "bash src/scripts/local/deploy-med.sh",
        "deploy:agro": "bash src/scripts/local/deploy-agro.sh",
        "deploy:fut": "bash src/scripts/local/deploy-fut.sh",
        "deploy:docker:med": "bash src/scripts/docker/deploy-docker-med.sh",
        "deploy:docker:agro": "bash src/scripts/docker/deploy-docker-agro.sh",
        "deploy:docker:fut": "bash src/scripts/docker/deploy-docker-fut.sh",
        "test:model": "tsx src/test/test.ts",
        "test:earley": "tsx src/test/earley.test.ts",
        "test:avaliar": "tsx src/test/avaliar.test.ts",
        "test:grammar": "cd src/python_engine && python test_grammar.py",
        "test": "npm run typecheck && npm run validate && npm run bnf:export && npm run test:earley && npm run test:avaliar && npm run test:foco-politica && npm run test:foco && npm run test:recuperacao && npm run test:consulta && npm run test:rag && npm run test:cypher && npm run test:hibrida && npm run test:rastro && npm run test:politica && npm run test:geracao && npm run test:contrato && npm run test:incremental && npm run test:grammar",
        "test:foco-politica": "tsx src/test/foco-politica.test.ts",
        "test:foco": "tsx src/test/foco.test.ts",
        "test:recuperacao": "tsx src/test/recuperacao.test.ts",
        "test:consulta": "tsx src/test/consulta-semantica.test.ts",
        "test:rag": "tsx src/test/recuperacao-rag.test.ts",
        "test:cypher": "tsx src/test/recuperacao-cypher.test.ts",
        "test:hibrida": "tsx src/test/recuperacao-hibrida.test.ts",
        "test:rastro": "tsx src/test/rastreabilidade.test.ts",
        "test:politica": "tsx src/test/recuperacao-politica.test.ts",
        "test:geracao": "tsx src/test/geracao-refinada.test.ts",
        "test:equivalencia": "tsx src/test/equivalencia.test.ts",
        "test:contrato": "tsx src/test/contrato.test.ts",
        "test:incremental": "tsx src/test/incremental.test.ts"
    },
    "keywords": [
        "dsl",
        "langium",
        "grammar-prompting",
        "constrained-decoding",
        "knowledge-graph",
        "neo4j",
        "clinical-decision-support"
    ],
    "author": "",
    "license": "ISC",
    "_comentario_overrides": "O langium-cli ate a 4.3.0 publica langium-config-schema.json sem $id. O jsonschema 1.5.0 monta entao a base do documento como resolveUrl(undefined, '') === '/undefined'; cada $ref vira '/undefined#/$defs/...', e o new URL(ref, 'thismessage::/') interno estoura ERR_INVALID_URL porque 'thismessage::/' tem caminho opaco e nao serve de base para referencia absoluta. Resultado: `langium generate` morre antes de validar nada. O 1.4.1 resolve os mesmos $ref e continua cobrando required e additionalProperties (verificado: rejeita propriedade inventada e obrigatoria faltando). Pin em vez de subir para langium-cli 4.4.0 (que adicionou o $id) porque a 4.4.0 arrasta langium ~4.4.0, e as BNF em src/python_engine/grammar sao reproduzidas byte a byte pelo langium 4.2.x. Remover este bloco ao migrar para o 4.4.",
    "overrides": {
        "jsonschema": "1.4.1"
    },
    "dependencies": {
        "langium": "^4.2.1",
        "neo4j-driver": "^6.0.1",
        "vscode-languageclient": "^9.0.1",
        "vscode-languageserver": "^9.0.1"
    },
    "devDependencies": {
        "@types/node": "^25.5.0",
        "@types/vscode": "^1.110.0",
        "langium-cli": "^4.2.0",
        "ts-node": "^10.9.2",
        "tsx": "^4.23.12",
        "typescript": "^5.9.3"
    }
}
